 "remarks": "Live large in this charming, sun filled standalone cottage, completely renovated to the studs in 2020. Vaulted ceilings with exposed beams create an open, airy feel, while hardwood floors flow through the living room, bedroom and kitchen. A fireplace adds warmth and character, giving this cottage the feel of a true home rather than simply a rental. Sliders open to a private patio and fenced yard with a gate, creating a wonderful extension of the living space and an especially appealing feature for a pet friendly rental. A stacked washer and dryer are included, along with convenient off-street parking. Ideally located close to everything Darien has to offer, with town, the train and beach all within easy reach. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy the privacy of a standalone cottage, your own outdoor space and a beautifully renovated interior in an exceptional Darien location. Available through April. Flexible terms can be offered. Pet friendly. Small fenced in area for dog enjoyment. Walk, stroll or roll to train.",
